# Copy to `.env.local` for local dev. Start Postgres: `docker compose up -d`
# Port 5433 = Docker mapping in docker-compose.yml (avoids conflict with a local Postgres on 5432).
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://strava:strava@localhost:5433/strava"
# Prisma CLI (`migrate`, etc.) reads DIRECT_URL first in prisma.config.ts; use your non-pooling URL in production.
DIRECT_URL="postgresql://strava:strava@localhost:5433/strava"
# Optional TLS: in `next dev`, TLS to the DB uses relaxed cert verify by default (see src/lib/prisma.ts).
# For production-like verify against a DB with a custom CA, set DATABASE_SSL_REJECT_UNAUTHORIZED=1.
# To relax verify outside dev (e.g. staging), set DATABASE_SSL_REJECT_UNAUTHORIZED=0 or DATABASE_SSL_VERIFY=0.
# Or append ?sslmode=no-verify to DATABASE_URL if your driver respects it (we map it to pg ssl config).

# Clerk, Strava, OpenAI, Resend, STRAVA_VERIFY_TOKEN — same names as production.
